            "body": "This is already possible with `MiniFiles.config.windows.preview = not MiniFiles.config.windows.preview` command. It will take effect on the next refresh (usually when moving up/down/in/out).",
            "bodyHTML": "<p dir=\"auto\">This is already possible with <code class=\"notranslate\">MiniFiles.config.windows.preview = not MiniFiles.config.windows.preview</code> command. It will take effect on the next refresh (usually when moving up/down/in/out).</p>",
            "bodyText": "This is already possible with MiniFiles.config.windows.preview = not MiniFiles.config.windows.preview command. It will take effect on the next refresh (usually when moving up/down/in/out).",
