                    "authorAssociation": "MEMBER",
                    "body": "I'd suggest to not have all that, as it might introduce some unexpected behavior. My suggestion would be to just toggle with the `MiniFiles.config.windows.preview = not MiniFiles.config.windows.preview` and then manually move cursor. I don't think it should be a frequent occasion to toggle preview, so this should be fine.",
                    "bodyHTML": "<p dir=\"auto\">I'd suggest to not have all that, as it might introduce some unexpected behavior. My suggestion would be to just toggle with the <code class=\"notranslate\">MiniFiles.config.windows.preview = not MiniFiles.config.windows.preview</code> and then manually move cursor. I don't think it should be a frequent occasion to toggle preview, so this should be fine.</p>",
                    "bodyText": "I'd suggest to not have all that, as it might introduce some unexpected behavior. My suggestion would be to just toggle with the MiniFiles.config.windows.preview = not MiniFiles.config.windows.preview and then manually move cursor. I don't think it should be a frequent occasion to toggle preview, so this should be fine.",
