            "authorAssociation": "NONE",
            "body": "I stumbled upon this thread and have something very similar in my config\r\n\r\n```lua\r\nvim.api.nvim_create_autocmd(\"User\", {\r\n  pattern = \"MiniFilesBufferCreate\",\r\n  callback = function(args)\r\n    vim.keymap.set(\"n\", \"<C-p>\", function()\r\n      MiniFiles = require(\"mini.files\")\r\n      MiniFiles.config.windows.preview = not MiniFiles.config.windows.preview\r\n      MiniFiles.refresh({ windows = { preview = MiniFiles.config.windows.preview } })\r\n    end, { desc = \"toggle preview\" })\r\n  end,\r\n})\r\n```\r\n\r\nThis works but the only issue I see is that when preview is turned off the `MiniFiles.refresh` does not completely close the preview window until I press a key.\r\n\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c46747cf-688a-4467-867e-84fd2088cf76\r\n\r\n",
            "bodyHTML": "<p dir=\"auto\">I stumbled upon this thread and have something very similar in my config</p>\n<div class=\"highlight highlight-source-lua notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"vim.api.nvim_create_autocmd(&quot;User&quot;, {\n  pattern = &quot;MiniFilesBufferCreate&quot;,\n  callback = function(args)\n    vim.keymap.set(&quot;n&quot;, &quot;&lt;C-p&gt;&quot;, function()\n      MiniFiles = require(&quot;mini.files&quot;)\n      MiniFiles.config.windows.preview = not MiniFiles.config.windows.preview\n      MiniFiles.refresh({ windows = { preview = MiniFiles.config.windows.preview } })\n    end, { desc = &quot;toggle preview&quot; })\n  end,\n})\"><pre class=\"notranslate\"><span class=\"pl-smi\">vim</span>.<span class=\"pl-e\">api</span>.<span class=\"pl-c1\">nvim_create_autocmd</span>(<span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>User<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>, {\n  <span class=\"pl-smi\">pattern</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>MiniFilesBufferCreate<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>,\n  <span class=\"pl-en\">callback</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">function</span>(<span class=\"pl-smi\">args</span>)\n    <span class=\"pl-smi\">vim</span>.<span class=\"pl-e\">keymap</span>.<span class=\"pl-c1\">set</span>(<span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>n<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>, <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>&lt;C-p&gt;<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>, <span class=\"pl-k\">function</span>()\n      <span class=\"pl-smi\">MiniFiles</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-c1\">require</span>(<span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>mini.files<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>)\n      <span class=\"pl-smi\">MiniFiles</span>.<span class=\"pl-e\">config</span>.<span class=\"pl-e\">windows</span>.<span class=\"pl-e\">preview</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">not</span> <span class=\"pl-smi\">MiniFiles</span>.<span class=\"pl-e\">config</span>.<span class=\"pl-e\">windows</span>.<span class=\"pl-e\">preview</span>\n      <span class=\"pl-smi\">MiniFiles</span>.<span class=\"pl-c1\">refresh</span>({ <span class=\"pl-smi\">windows</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> { <span class=\"pl-smi\">preview</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-smi\">MiniFiles</span>.<span class=\"pl-e\">config</span>.<span class=\"pl-e\">windows</span>.<span class=\"pl-e\">preview</span> } })\n    <span class=\"pl-k\">end</span>, { <span class=\"pl-smi\">desc</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>toggle preview<span class=\"pl-pds\">\" </span></span>})\n  <span class=\"pl-k\">end</span>,\n})</pre></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">This works but the only issue I see is that when preview is turned off the <code class=\"notranslate\">MiniFiles.refresh</code> does not completely close the preview window until I press a key.</p>\n<details open=\"\" class=\"details-reset border rounded-2\">\n  <summary class=\"tmp-px-3 py-2\">\n    <svg aria-hidden=\"true\" data-component=\"Octicon\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" data-view-component=\"true\" class=\"octicon octicon-device-camera-video\">\n    <path d=\"M16 3.75v8.5a.75.75 0 0 1-1.136.643L11 10.575v.675A1.75 1.75 0 0 1 9.25 13h-7.5A1.75 1.75 0 0 1 0 11.25v-6.5C0 3.784.784 3 1.75 3h7.5c.966 0 1.75.784 1.75 1.75v.675l3.864-2.318A.75.75 0 0 1 16 3.75Zm-6.5 1a.25.25 0 0 0-.25-.25h-7.5a.25.25 0 0 0-.25.25v6.5c0 .138.112.25.25.25h7.5a.25.25 0 0 0 .25-.25v-6.5ZM11 8.825l3.5 2.1v-5.85l-3.5 2.1Z\"></path>\n</svg>\n    <span class=\"m-1\">mini.mp4</span>\n    <span class=\"dropdown-caret\"></span>\n  </summary>\n\n  <video src=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/19793591/438744110-c46747cf-688a-4467-867e-84fd2088cf76.mp4?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..49hTGT7G6voiksXFKOGEOpafKekoDKOn6tX75JF-6dw\" data-canonical-src=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/19793591/438744110-c46747cf-688a-4467-867e-84fd2088cf76.mp4?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..49hTGT7G6voiksXFKOGEOpafKekoDKOn6tX75JF-6dw\" controls=\"controls\" muted=\"muted\" class=\"d-block rounded-bottom-2 border-top width-fit\" style=\"max-height:640px; min-height: 200px\">\n\n  </video>\n</details>\n",
            "bodyText": "I stumbled upon this thread and have something very similar in my config\nvim.api.nvim_create_autocmd(\"User\", {\n  pattern = \"MiniFilesBufferCreate\",\n  callback = function(args)\n    vim.keymap.set(\"n\", \"<C-p>\", function()\n      MiniFiles = require(\"mini.files\")\n      MiniFiles.config.windows.preview = not MiniFiles.config.windows.preview\n      MiniFiles.refresh({ windows = { preview = MiniFiles.config.windows.preview } })\n    end, { desc = \"toggle preview\" })\n  end,\n})\nThis works but the only issue I see is that when preview is turned off the MiniFiles.refresh does not completely close the preview window until I press a key.\n\n  \n    \n    \n\n    mini.mp4",
